{"unit_id":"ChaoYuZhang001__dsh-auto-router#card-zh","repo":"ChaoYuZhang001/dsh-auto-router","commit":"7614d173b5907db9efb9aeaf8f4d174f9996f8f5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-router 是一个 DSH 模型路由插件，会向模型提供商列表注册虚拟提供商，并把请求转发到已有提供商的具体模型。它根据最近的用户消息识别图像、代码、复杂或较长任务以及普通短请求，分别选择视觉、代码、深度、均衡或快速档；也提供五种固定档位供用户直接选择。用户可配置目标提供商、各档位模型、阈值和会话粘性，适合希望按任务自动分配模型或在 DSH 中手动切换模型档位的用户。需预先配置目标提供商及其模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-41","lib/index.js:53-77","lib/index.js:89-137"]}
{"unit_id":"ChaoYuZhang001__dsh-auto-router#card-en","repo":"ChaoYuZhang001/dsh-auto-router","commit":"7614d173b5907db9efb9aeaf8f4d174f9996f8f5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-router adds a synthetic DSH provider that routes requests to configured models on an existing provider. It classifies image, code, complex, and short requests into vision, code, heavy, and lighter tiers, with fixed tier choices too. The target provider and models must exist.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-41","lib/index.js:53-77","lib/index.js:89-137"]}
