{"unit_id":"ChaoYuZhang001__dsh-auto-router#feature-1","repo":"ChaoYuZhang001/dsh-auto-router","commit":"7614d173b5907db9efb9aeaf8f4d174f9996f8f5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-router 的功能「按请求内容分类」：自动检查近期用户消息，含图片时选择视觉档，代码特征选择代码档，复杂或较长内容选择深度或均衡档，其余选择快速档。发送模型请求时触发分类。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:53-77","lib/index.js:132-136"]}
{"unit_id":"ChaoYuZhang001__dsh-auto-router#feature-2","repo":"ChaoYuZhang001/dsh-auto-router","commit":"7614d173b5907db9efb9aeaf8f4d174f9996f8f5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-router 的功能「手动选择固定档位」：模型列表提供快速、均衡、深度、代码和视觉选项。用户在 DSH 模型选择器选定一个选项后，插件把请求转给配置中对应的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-39","lib/index.js:89-92","lib/index.js:111-118"]}
{"unit_id":"ChaoYuZhang001__dsh-auto-router#feature-3","repo":"ChaoYuZhang001/dsh-auto-router","commit":"7614d173b5907db9efb9aeaf8f4d174f9996f8f5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-router 的功能「按会话保持档位」：启用 sticky 后，插件记录会话已选档位；同一会话后续分类不高于已有档位时继续使用原模型，升级时采用新档位。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-41","lib/index.js:93-101"]}
